<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Remember to set your own buttons in game before activate this macro. (mine is xb1 and xb2)

Just a simple macro made for the Destroyer with skills -- Judgement and Cleave.

I don't recommend using it when lots of mons around you.

Simple LMB - RMB.

The best of dungeon and mobs ,and ford raid!</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
LeftDown 1
Delay 64
LeftUp 1
Delay 64
Delay 120 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 200 ms
RightDown 1
Delay 200 ms
RightUp 1
Delay 0 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Blade &amp; Soul</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
